WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.997
"Ugh!" Terrell thought. "Another earthquake!"

2
00:00:04.998 --> 00:00:08.047
Miss Apricot's students hid under their desks.

3
00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:12.239
A globe rolled off a table. Books fell from shelves.

4
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.709
Terrell tried to text Roxy again, but his messages still weren't going through.

5
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.099
He texted Roxy's mom, and she texted back right away.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.731
She was worried too—she couldn't reach Roxy either.

7
00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:25.528
The shaking stopped.

8
00:00:25.529 --> 00:00:30.955
Miss Apricot picked up the globe. "Everyone, let's clean up!"

9
00:00:30.956 --> 00:00:34.099
Terrell, Jack, and Mara picked up books.

10
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.210
"We should have an earthquake day," Jack said.

11
00:00:37.211 --> 00:00:40.156
"It would be like a snow day but more fun!"

12
00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:42.111
Mara gave him a funny look.

13
00:00:42.112 --> 00:00:47.950
"You think this is fun? I'm dizzy! I might need to go to the nurse."

14
00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:51.579
"Hey!" Jack suddenly said. "Is Roxy okay?

15
00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.061
She went to the nurse hours ago."

16
00:00:54.062 --> 00:00:57.319
"I just got a text from her," Terrell said quickly.

17
00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.124
"Her, um, mom picked her up."

18
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:04.977
"Attention, please!" Principal Penn's voice came over the loudspeaker.

19
00:01:04.978 --> 00:01:09.045
"We're dismissing early today because of the earthquakes."

20
00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:14.179
Jack pumped his fist. "Yes! It's our first earthquake day!"

21
00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:17.640
Mara rolled her eyes as she packed her things.

22
00:01:17.641 --> 00:01:19.298
Everyone went outside.

23
00:01:19.299 --> 00:01:22.524
A line of cars slowly made its way past the entrance.

24
00:01:22.525 --> 00:01:25.015
One by one, students left.

25
00:01:25.016 --> 00:01:28.328
Finally Terrell saw Roxy's mom.

26
00:01:28.329 --> 00:01:31.437
She looked worried.

27
00:01:31.438 --> 00:01:34.284
Terrell got in the car and buckled his seatbelt.

28
00:01:34.285 --> 00:01:38.676
Roxy's mom started to drive. "Did you hear from Roxy yet?"

29
00:01:38.677 --> 00:01:42.712
"No." Terrell tried texting Roxy again.

30
00:01:42.713 --> 00:01:45.006
That message didn't go through either.

31
00:01:45.007 --> 00:01:46.785
Roxy's mom frowned.

32
00:01:46.786 --> 00:01:50.236
"She told me earlier that she had a Rocket Girl mission.

33
00:01:50.237 --> 00:01:52.815
But that was hours ago."

34
00:01:52.816 --> 00:01:56.773
"She might be trying to stop the earthquakes," Terrell said.

35
00:01:56.774 --> 00:02:00.690
"I'll check the news. Maybe there's a story about it."

36
00:02:00.691 --> 00:02:03.119
He scrolled though the news app on his phone.

37
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.779
He saw lots of headlines about the earthquakes.

38
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.415
But there wasn't anything about Rocket Girl.

39
00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:14.099
Terrell groaned. "I don't understand why my messages won't go through.

40
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:18.248
Unless she's in outer space? But then what can we do?

41
00:02:18.249 --> 00:02:23.392
She could be anywhere in the . . ." He gasped. "Galaxy Squad!"

42
00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:26.928
"What about the Galaxy Squad?" Roxy's mom asked.

43
00:02:26.929 --> 00:02:30.051
"I'm a member," Terrell said proudly.

44
00:02:30.052 --> 00:02:33.579
"And that means, I know who to call!"

45
00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.394
"Shaking, Earth!" Bippo said.

46
00:02:36.395 --> 00:02:39.684
Dr. Odd flew his mobile lab over Metro City.

47
00:02:39.685 --> 00:02:41.417
He headed toward the mountains.

48
00:02:41.418 --> 00:02:44.622
Down below, another earthquake shook the buildings.

49
00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:46.580
Finally it stopped.

50
00:02:46.581 --> 00:02:48.570
Dr. Odd checked a screen.

51
00:02:48.571 --> 00:02:52.298
"The earthquakes are getting much stronger."

52
00:02:52.299 --> 00:02:55.455
His phone buzzed. "Hello?"

53
00:02:55.456 --> 00:02:58.113
"Dr. Odd!" Terrell said.

54
00:02:58.114 --> 00:03:01.649
"I'm very busy, Terrell," Dr. Odd said.

55
00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.806
"Mayor Bloom asked me to investigate the earthquakes.

56
00:03:04.807 --> 00:03:09.899
I'm heading toward their source now. Metro City is in big danger."

57
00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:14.041
"I think Rocket Girl is in danger too," Terrell said.

58
00:03:14.042 --> 00:03:16.685
"I don't know where she is."

59
00:03:16.686 --> 00:03:22.556
"Hmm." Dr. Odd scratched his head. "She probably just went home."

60
00:03:22.557 --> 00:03:25.540
"No, she didn't!" Roxy's mom said.

61
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:29.279
"I'm her mom. We're very worried!"

62
00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:35.403
"Oh dear." Dr. Odd pressed some buttons.

63
00:03:35.404 --> 00:03:39.361
"I'm sending you a location. Can you meet me there?"

64
00:03:39.362 --> 00:03:42.399
"Yes, of course," Roxy's mom said.

65
00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.699
A location appeared on Terrell's phone.

66
00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.458
It was in the mountains.

67
00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:49.436
"We're on our way," Terrell said.

68
00:03:49.437 --> 00:03:51.839
"Good," Dr. Odd said.

69
00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:56.115
"Because the people of Metro City now have two big problems.

70
00:03:56.116 --> 00:03:59.953
They need the Galaxy Squad!"

